WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.915
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama sees a round book. Which sentence describes it?

00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:10.562
The answer is: The book is round.. Use a describing word to tell about an object.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:16.631
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama draws a beautiful tree. Which sentence shares a

00:00:16.631 --> 00:00:17.383
matching opinion?

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.785
The answer is: I think a beautiful tree looks lovely.. Write a sentence that

00:00:22.785 --> 00:00:24.749
expresses an opinion about your drawing.
